# User crontab for the NUC (install with `crontab -e`).
# Replace <your-id> with the ping URL ID from the healthchecks.io dashboard.
# Never commit the real ID.

# Heartbeat: tell healthchecks.io the NUC is alive, every 5 minutes
*/5 * * * * curl -fsS -m 10 --retry 5 -o /dev/null https://hc-ping.com/<your-id>
